#: export.cpp:39
msgid "CSV"
msgstr "CSV"

#: export.cpp:40
msgid ""
"Export to a text file, using semicolons as separators.<p></p>Can be used for "
"spreadsheet programs like <i>KSpread</i>."
msgstr ""
"匯出至文字檔案，使用分號為分隔字元。<p></P>可用於如 <i>KSpread</i> 的試算表程"
"式。"

#: export.cpp:42
msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

#: export.cpp:43
msgid ""
"Export to a HTML Page.<p></p>Can be used for easy exchange over the "
"<i>Internet</i>."
msgstr "匯出至 HTML 頁。<p></P>可於<i>互聯網</i>上方便地交換。"

